From 50d8a1e19d469ea41ea72909bb805b6554139ffa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:02:43 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat(inkling2): trail points - a prompt that parts from
 the cached tokens mid-way resumes from the nearest saved ring state

A sequence resumed only from a state that is a whole prefix of the new prompt. Every NINFER_TRAIL_GRID prompt
tokens (default max(8192, max_context/32)) the sequence's rings are copied to host memory (NINFER_TRAIL_MIB,
default 4096); a prompt that starts with a point's tokens resumes there from the live sequence or a stored image.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
